<title>GERMANY: Puma says to pay four percent dividend.</title>
<headline>Puma says to pay four percent dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HERZOGENAURACH, Germany 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>German sportswear maker Puma AG said on Friday it wants to pay a dividend of four percent on earnings, or a payout of 20 pfennigs per five mark nominal value share.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
